@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description

[*] --> Active : add / generate UUID
Active --> Deleted : delete [no open loan] / set deleted = true
Deleted --> Active : restore / set deleted = false

note right of Active
  Edits preserve UUID and active state.
  Open loans allow details/condition edits.
  Availability stays ASSIGNED until return.
end note
note right of Deleted
  UUID, details and closed loans retained.
  New loans and edits rejected.
  Restore has no time limit.
end note
@enduml
